+## [0.4.0] - 2026-10-20
+
+### Added
+
+- `VertexConfig.apiEndpoint` is an optional additive field passed through to `new VertexAI({apiEndpoint})` (for example, `aiplatform.eu.rep.googleapis.com` with `location: 'eu'` to reach the Vertex EU multi-region endpoint). When omitted, default behaviour is unchanged and the SDK continues to derive the regional endpoint from `location`.
+
